sequenceDiagram
  participant App as App<br/>(getaddrinfo)
  participant Stub as Stub resolver<br/>(glibc, Go net)
  participant Rec as Recursive resolver<br/>(8.8.8.8)
  participant Root as Root NS<br/>(a.root-servers.net)
  participant TLD as .com NS<br/>(gtld-servers.net)
  participant Auth as example.com<br/>authoritative
  participant Cache as Recursive<br/>cache (RAM/DB)

  App->>Stub: getaddrinfo(www.example.com)
  Stub->>Rec: UDP 53 query A www.example.com (recursive)
  Note over Rec: Cache miss
  Rec->>Root: UDP 53 query (iterative)
  Root-->>Rec: referral .com NS list
  Rec->>TLD: UDP 53 query (iterative)
  TLD-->>Rec: referral example.com NS list
  Rec->>Auth: UDP 53 query (iterative)
  Auth-->>Rec: answer A 93.184.216.34 TTL 86400
  Rec->>Cache: store name type IP TTL expiry
  Rec-->>Stub: UDP 53 answer
  Stub-->>App: 93.184.216.34
  Note over Stub,Cache: Truy vấn sau trong TTL: cache hit, không đi ra Internet
  Note over Rec: Neu response > 512 byte EDNS, chuyen TCP 53
  Note over Rec: DNSSEC: xac thuc bang DS chain tu root